    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chroam is an Escape Room-style adventure game, in which you will be asked to try your hand at numerous and original puzzles. It will take all your skill to solve these puzzles, some of which seem impossible. Open the doors, observe every little detail inside the various rooms and finally solve the mystery of the glass doors of the maze on the upper floor. Have fun!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743980/extras/0724e653cddb5946c93aa55997def665.avif?t=1751094551\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chroam is an Escape Room-style adventure game, in which you will be asked to try your hand at numerous and original puzzles. It will take all your skill to solve these puzzles, some of which seem impossible. Open the doors, observe every little detail inside the various rooms and finally solve the mystery of the glass doors of the maze on the upper floor. Have fun!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743980/extras/0724e653cddb5946c93aa55997def665.avif?t=1751094551\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>",
